  {id: 2, book: "Work", pinned: true, mins: 52,
    title: "Panel runtime - open questions",
    lines: [
      "Notes ahead of Thursday's review. None of this is decided.",
      "",
      "1. Sleep window. A panel stops ticking ten seconds after the last",
      "   input. Fine for a form, wrong for a clock. Do we want an opt-in",
      "   keep-awake, or is a host timer the honest answer?",
