  {id: 3, book: "Ideas", pinned: false, mins: 190,
    title: "A quieter kind of search",
    lines: [
      "What if search never navigated anywhere? It only dims what does not match and leaves everything exactly where it was, so you never lose your place while you are looking for something.",
