  ]},
  {id: 5, book: "Reading", pinned: false, mins: 1520,
    title: "The Overstory - marginalia",
    lines: [
      "p.148 - \"The best arguments in the world won't change a person's",
      "mind. The only thing that can do that is a good story.\" Underlined",
      "twice by whoever had this copy before me.",
      "",
      "The structural conceit (roots, trunk, crown, seeds) does real work",
