      "",
      "Still: nothing else I have read makes time feel that long.",
  ]},
  {id: 6, book: "Work", pinned: false, mins: 2600,
    title: "Interview loop - compiler role",
    lines: [
      "Four stages. Nothing longer than two hours of anyone's evening.",
      "",
      "  1. Phone screen, 30m - one small parsing problem, out loud",
